      <p>The following permissions are required for deleting an OpenShift Container Platform cluster on Microsoft Azure.</p>
      <Fragment set:html={"<details>\n<summary>Required permissions for deleting authorization resources</summary>\n"} />
      <ul><li><code>Microsoft.Authorization/roleAssignments/delete</code></li></ul>
