      <h4 id="_supported_azure_short_government_regions" class="group scroll-mt-20">Supported Azure Government regions<a href="#_supported_azure_short_government_regions" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h4>
